    "scope": "Three actually inspected exterior pictures and standard viewer PMTiles/DEM. No bespoke survey research or redistributed pictures.",
    "pictures": [
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gurk_Dom_West-Ansicht_und_Hans_Kudlich-Denkmal_11042016_1408.jpg",
        "author": "Johann Jaritz",
        "date": "2016-04-11",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "observed": "Inspected enlarged west view: two tall pale square towers above a stone west block, sparse shaft openings and paired belfry lights, broad flared caps, large onion bulbs, small octagonal lantern stages, smaller top bulbs and gilded finials. Low central roof has a small dormer. Trees, wall and Kudlich monument obscure the entrance/base; these foreground objects are excluded."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gurk_Domplatz_1_Dom_drei_Apsiden_Ost-Ansicht_22042019_6669.jpg",
        "author": "Johann Jaritz",
        "date": "2019-04-22",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "observed": "Inspected enlarged east apses: large central rounded ashlar apse and smaller flank apses with dark shallow conical/hipped roofs. Tall blind Romanesque arches/pilasters, narrow round lights and small crypt vents; arcaded/dentil cornices below caps. Broad church wall with round lights above; white chapter building touches the north side but remains host content."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gurk_Domstift_und_Befestigungsanlagen_06042013_771.jpg",
        "author": "Johann Jaritz",
        "date": "2013-04-06",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-3.0-AT OR CC-BY-SA-3.0",
        "observed": "Inspected wider southwest exterior: long blue-grey metal-roofed nave and lower aisle, small round clerestory/aisle lights, stone west-front portal and pale twin shafts; paired belfry lights, a clock on the farther tower, two bulb stages/open lanterns and gold tips. Monastery, cemetery, detached chapel, enclosure and town roofs are separate. Some base/east joins are hidden."
      }
    ]
  }
